2:T528,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is GPT-6 Astra?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GPT-6 Astra is OpenAI's frontier intelligence model featuring major breakthroughs in computer use, mathematical problem solving (FrontierMath 98%), abstract reasoning (ARC-AGI-3 99.9%), and professional workflow execution."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the GPT-6 Astra price and API cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GPT-6 Astra standard API pricing is set at $10 per million input tokens and $50 per million output tokens, with Fast Mode available at 2x speed for $20 input and $100 output per million tokens."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is GPT-6 AGI?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"While GPT-6 Astra saturates ARC-AGI-3 with 99.9% accuracy and reaches human parity on 96% of problem levels, true AGI requires autonomous self-improvement and open-ended agency in physical environments."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can we use GPT-6 Astra for daily schedule planning?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GPT-6 Astra features advanced computer and calendar automation, 1.9x faster web browsing, and multi-step task synthesis, making it capable of dynamically managing calendars and daily study routines."}}]}a:["slug","gpt-6-astra-launch-benchmarks-review","d"]
