3:[["$","div",null,{"className":"aeo-answer tl-dr","children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Quick Answer:"}]," OpenAI has officially unveiled ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"GPT-6 Astra"}],", hailed as a step change in frontier intelligence. Scoring 99.9% on ARC-AGI-3 and 97.6% on FrontierMath Tier 4, Astra delivers state-of-the-art computer use and agentic problem solving at $10 per million input tokens. Vote below on whether PlanBot should adopt GPT-6 Astra into our daily AI schedule generator."]}]}],"\n",["$","$L11",null,{"pollId":"gpt-6-astra-planbot","question":"Should PlanBot Integrate OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra into Our Daily AI Planner?","subtitle":"Vote to decide whether next-generation Astra intelligence should power PlanBot's dynamic schedule engine.","opt1":"Yes — Bring GPT-6 Astra frontier reasoning & speed","opt2":"No — Keep current models & prioritize privacy and battery"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["The global artificial intelligence landscape shifted dramatically today as OpenAI officially introduced ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"GPT-6 Astra"}],". Billed as the world's most intelligent and aligned model, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt 6 astra"}]," represents years of breakthroughs across pre-training, reinforcement learning, and agentic computer control."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Whether you are searching for ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"astra"}],", ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"astra 6"}],", or evaluating ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"astra gpt 6"}]," for enterprise productivity, this launch is sending shockwaves across the tech industry. In this comprehensive breakdown, we examine the official ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt 6 astra benchmark"}]," results, review ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt astra 6 price"}]," structures, explore ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"how we can use gpt 6 astra"}],", and discuss whether ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"is gpt 6 agi"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"GPT-6 Astra Benchmark: Record-Shattering Frontier Scores"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["According to OpenAI's official release (",["$","code",null,{"children":"https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra/"}],"), ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt astra"}]," saturates several of the most challenging academic and real-world evaluation suites ever created."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Here is how ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt 6 astra"}]," compares against previous state-of-the-art models:"]}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Benchmark Evaluation"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"GPT-6 Astra"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"GPT-5.6 Sol"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Claude Opus 5"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Gemini 3.8 Flash"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"ARC-AGI-3 (Abstract Reasoning)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"99.9%"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"7.8%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"30.2%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"—"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"FrontierMath Tier 4 (v2)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"97.6%"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"83.0%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"73.2%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"—"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"ExploitBench (Cybersecurity)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"100.0%"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"78.5%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"70.0%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"—"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"OSWorld 2.0 (Computer Use)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"72.6%"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"65.7%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"70.2%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"—"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"ScreenSpot-Pro (Visual QA)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"92.7%"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"76.9%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"—"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"—"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"GPQA Diamond (Science QA)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"96.0%"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"94.6%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"93.7%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"95.3%"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Terminal-Bench 4.0 (Coding)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"57.9%"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"37.3%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"52.6%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"19.1%"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"SRE-Bench (Reverse Engineering)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"88.0%"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"55.9%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"12.5%"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"—"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"On the famous ARC-AGI-3 evaluation, Greg Kamradt from the ARC Prize Foundation noted:"}],"\n",["$","blockquote",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","em",null,{"children":"\"On ARC-AGI-3, Astra surpassed our human action-efficiency baseline on 96% of levels, effectively reaching human parity on the benchmark. Not only is this the best model we’ve ever tested, but it also represents a meaningful step change in frontier-model performance.\""}]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["In cybersecurity, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"astra gpt"}]," achieved a perfect 100% on ExploitBench and even discovered two previously unknown zero-day vulnerabilities during evaluation runs."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"GPT-6 Astra Price & Cost: What Developers and Users Pay"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["One of the biggest trending questions today is ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt astra 6 price"}]," and ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt 6 astra cost"}],". OpenAI has structured access across standard API channels and subscription tiers:"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"1. OpenAI API Pricing"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Standard Input Tokens:"}]," $10.00 per million tokens."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Standard Output Tokens:"}]," $50.00 per million tokens."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fast Mode:"}]," Delivers up to 2x processing throughput at 2x the standard price ($20 input / $100 output per million tokens)."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"API Model ID:"}]," Available as ",["$","code",null,{"children":"gpt-6-astra"}]," in the OpenAI API, Microsoft Azure, and Amazon Bedrock."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"2. Consumer & Enterprise Availability"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"ChatGPT Plus & Pro:"}]," ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"chat gpt"}]," users on Plus and Pro will receive ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt chat"}]," access rolled out gradually within existing subscription allowances."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Business & Enterprise:"}]," Organizations can enable ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"chat"}]," with Astra, while Pro, Business, and Enterprise plans also unlock access to ",["$","em",null,{"children":"GPT-6 Astra Pro"}],"."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Compared to the computational horsepower required to run 99.9% ARC-AGI-3 reasoning, this pricing is competitive against enterprise human-hour equivalents."}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Is GPT-6 AGI?"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["The question buzzing across Google Trends and social feeds is: ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"is gpt 6 agi"}],"?"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Technically, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"astra 6"}]," satisfies many historical definitions of Artificial General Intelligence:"]}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Human Parity on Novel Reasoning:"}]," Surpassing human efficiency on 96% of ARC-AGI-3 levels demonstrates that Astra does not merely memorize patterns—it synthesizes novel abstract heuristics in real time."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Autonomous Computer Use:"}]," On OSWorld 2.0, Astra executes complex operating system tasks in 47% less time than previous models, completing complex multi-step digital knowledge work without human intervention."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mathematical Discovery:"}]," Astra has already helped narrow bounds on prime number gaps from 240 down to 186, proving frontier research utility."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["However, OpenAI's alignment research team clarifies that while ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt astra 6"}]," sets the new frontier, autonomous open-ended physical robotics and indefinite self-directed evolution remain distinct milestones. For digital knowledge work, however, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"astra"}]," provides near-AGI cognitive assistance."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"GPT 6 Astra How to Use: Productivity & Schedule Planning"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Understanding ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"how we can use gpt 6 astra"}]," and ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt 6 astra how to use"}]," in daily routines is critical for students and professionals."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Here are the four primary ways to deploy Astra:"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"1. Zero-Friction Multi-Step Daily Planning"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Traditional ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"chat"}]," models require extensive prompting to build a balanced study plan. With ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt chat"}],", Astra can autonomously inspect your incoming syllabus, evaluate calendar conflicts, calculate circadian energy dips, and generate an hour-by-hour time-blocked schedule."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"2. Autonomous Desktop & Calendar Management"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Because ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt-6-astra"}]," excels at computer use (OSWorld 72.6%), it can organize Google Calendar events, file tax documents, manage CRM records, and clean messy email inboxes without manual step-by-step guidance."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"3. Deep Work Sprint Allocation"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Astra understands cognitive fatigue curves. In ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"PlanBot"}],", scheduling algorithms determine when deep analytical focus should precede administrative shallow work. Combining Astra's reasoning with PlanBot's Android focus tracker creates an unbeatable productivity ecosystem."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Should PlanBot Use GPT-6 Astra?"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"At PlanBot, our mission is to provide the world's most intuitive, adaptive daily planner for students, athletes, and working professionals."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["While ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gpt 6 astra"}]," brings unprecedented reasoning to schedule generation, mobile daily planning also demands instant sub-second response times, offline battery efficiency, and strict privacy. That is why we are asking our community to vote in the live poll above!"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Whether we integrate Astra or continue fine-tuning lightweight, rapid-response planning models, you can always generate optimized daily timetables for free using our ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/tools/daily-schedule-generator","children":"AI Daily Schedule Generator"}]," or download the PlanBot Android app."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"When can I use GPT-6 Astra in ChatGPT?"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["OpenAI is rolling out ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"chat gpt"}]," access for Astra to ChatGPT Plus, Pro, Business, and Enterprise users starting today and expanding globally over the coming days."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"How does GPT-6 Astra compare to Claude and Gemini?"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Astra sets new high marks in abstract reasoning (ARC-AGI-3 99.9%) and computer use (OSWorld 72.6%), whereas Anthropic Claude models remain renowned for nuanced prose and Google Gemini leads in massive video context processing."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Can I try PlanBot's schedule generator right now?"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Yes! You can use PlanBot's free ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/tools/daily-schedule-generator","children":"AI Schedule Generator"}]," and ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/tools/weather-forecast","children":"Weather Forecast Planner"}]," directly in your browser without creating an account."]}]]
